{"page":96,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:106","surah":4,"ayah":106,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱسْتَغْفِرِ ٱللَّهَ ۖ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ كَانَ غَفُورًا رَّحِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Ask God for forgiveness: He is most forgiving and merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱسْتَغْفِرِ","en_gloss":"And seek forgiveness","transliteration":"wa-is'taghfiri","verse_key":"4:106"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"4:106"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"4:106"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"4:106"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"4:106"},{"pos":6,"ar":"غَفُورًۭا","en_gloss":"Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūran","verse_key":"4:106"},{"pos":7,"ar":"رَّحِيمًۭا","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīman","verse_key":"4:106"},{"pos":8,"ar":"١٠٦","en_gloss":"(106)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:106"}]},{"verse_key":"4:107","surah":4,"ayah":107,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا تُجَـٰدِلْ عَنِ ٱلَّذِينَ يَخْتَانُونَ أَنفُسَهُمْ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَا يُحِبُّ مَن كَانَ خَوَّانًا أَثِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do not argue for those who betray their own souls: God does not love anyone given to treachery and sin.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"4:107"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تُجَـٰدِلْ","en_gloss":"argue","transliteration":"tujādil","verse_key":"4:107"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"for","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"4:107"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"4:107"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَخْتَانُونَ","en_gloss":"deceive","transliteration":"yakhtānūna","verse_key":"4:107"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَنفُسَهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"themselves","transliteration":"anfusahum","verse_key":"4:107"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"4:107"},{"pos":8